{"id":"vod_sn_36289","vodId":"36289","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"恶魔人","name_cn":"恶魔人","date":"1972-01-01","year":"1972","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4d497a161b8ce1a5f0f2fea6ab30693a.jpg"},"summary":"《恶魔人》是由1972年东映、NET合作制作动画。原是地球支配者的恶魔族在喜玛拉雅山的冰块中复活，为了重新支配地球，魔王泽农派恶魔族的第一勇者恶魔人去人类界散播灾难的种子。此时正在登上喜玛拉雅山的不动教授及其子不动明意外跌入了恶魔族的冰国中，父子俩双双死于恶魔族的袭击之下，而死去的明则被恶魔人附身，在那以后，明因不动教授死去而搬到牧村教授的家中居住，在此期间对牧村教授的女儿美树产生了好感。突然有一天，牧村一家遭到恶魔族的袭击，明毅然变身成恶魔人与同族的人战斗，从此成为了恶魔族的叛徒，为了美树和地球而战……由于当年的电视尺度问题，动画和漫画内容差异巨大，被作者永井豪本人指摘为“使用同一设定的两套不同作品”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:55","playable":true,"episodeCount":39,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FEJsv0wKvL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/32ewKXeC9U1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EPtKxNbwV21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8hyVjsBgx91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/30cE1cicnE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wmExHH3hrY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vt9YQQQRc91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4vQeKnZQGM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YG3uLmX5en1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gGAycZ0Li01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hwhxeT0qLw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DPfAC1RDqj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pSrmgcjvm71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LhUBBZfifC1/video/index.m3u8"